            ]
         ]
      },
      {
         "step": 2,
         "text": "Substitute \\( u = 2x \\), raising the whole of \\( 2x \\) to each power: the series begins \\( 1 + 2x + 2x^{2} + \\frac{4}{3}x^{3} + \\cdots \\).",
         "mathjson": [
